# Bot Management API

### Start the bot
POST http://localhost:8080/bot/startup
Content-Type: application/json

### Get bot status
GET http://localhost:8080/bot/status

### Stop the bot
POST http://localhost:8080/bot/shutdown

### Force update commands for all guilds (INSTANT)
POST http://localhost:8080/bot/force-update-commands

### Register commands for a specific guild (INSTANT)
# Replace YOUR_GUILD_ID with your Discord server ID
POST http://localhost:8080/bot/register-guild-commands/YOUR_GUILD_ID


### Example with a real guild ID (update this with your server ID)
# To get your guild ID: Enable Developer Mode in Discord → Right-click your server → Copy Server ID
# POST http://localhost:8080/bot/register-guild-commands/123456789012345678
